---
import PasswordsIcon from './PasswordsIcon.astro';
import { sampleAccounts, samplePassword } from '../data/passwords-demo';
---
<div class="vault-wrap">
  <div class="vault-device" data-passwords-demo dir="rtl" lang="he" hidden>
    <div class="vault-statusbar" aria-hidden="true"><span>▰ ▴</span><span>9:41</span></div>
    <header class="vault-header"><span class="shield-badge"><PasswordsIcon name="shield" /></span><strong data-vault-title>MY PASSWORDS</strong><button class="icon-button" data-vault-action="home" aria-label="חזרה לרשומות" hidden>←</button></header>
    <div class="vault-scroll">
      <section data-vault-panel="welcome" aria-labelledby="vault-welcome-title">
        <span class="welcome-badge">הכספת הפרטית שלך</span>
        <div class="welcome-shield"><PasswordsIcon name="shield" /></div>
        <h3 id="vault-welcome-title" tabindex="-1">ברוך הבא למאגר הסיסמאות שלך</h3>
        <p class="welcome-copy">גישה נוחה לחשבונות החשובים לך, בממשק שנשאר קרוב אליך.</p>
        <div class="feature-row"><span class="shield-badge"><PasswordsIcon name="fingerprint" /></span><div><strong>רק לך יש גישה</strong><p>האפליקציה משתמשת באימות ביומטרי</p></div></div>
        <div class="feature-row"><span class="shield-badge"><PasswordsIcon name="lock" /></span><div><strong>המידע נשאר אצלך</strong><p>באפליקציה, האחסון נמצא במכשיר</p></div></div>
        <p class="simulation-note">הדגמת ממשק עם נתונים פיקטיביים בלבד.</p>
        <button class="vault-primary" data-vault-action="start">התחל תהליך אימות <span aria-hidden="true">←</span></button>
      </section>
      <section data-vault-panel="auth" hidden aria-labelledby="vault-auth-title">
        <div class="welcome-shield"><PasswordsIcon name="fingerprint" /></div>
        <h3 id="vault-auth-title" tabindex="-1">גישה לכספת</h3>
        <p>ב־MyPasswords, זהו השלב שבו מופעל האימות הביומטרי של Android.</p>
        <div class="feature-row"><span class="shield-badge"><PasswordsIcon name="shield" /></span><p>כאן זו סימולציה בלבד. אין סריקת טביעת אצבע או בדיקת זהות.</p></div>
        <button class="vault-primary" data-vault-action="unlock">פתח את כספת ההדגמה</button>
      </section>
      <section data-vault-panel="vault" hidden aria-labelledby="vault-list-title">
        <div class="vault-summary"><h3 id="vault-list-title" tabindex="-1">הכל במקום בטוח אחד</h3><p>גישה מהירה לחשבונות החשובים לך</p><span data-visible-count>3 פריטים בתצוגה</span></div>
        <label class="vault-search"><PasswordsIcon name="search" /><input type="search" data-vault-search aria-label="חיפוש ברשומות לדוגמה" placeholder="חיפוש בחשבונות לדוגמה" autocomplete="off" maxlength="80" /></label>
        <div class="vault-categories" role="group" aria-label="סינון לפי קטגוריה"><button data-vault-category="all" aria-pressed="true">הכל</button><button data-vault-category="work" aria-pressed="false">עבודה</button><button data-vault-category="personal" aria-pressed="false">אישי</button></div>
        <div class="vault-tools"><button data-vault-action="favorites" aria-pressed="false"><PasswordsIcon name="star" />מועדפים</button><button data-vault-action="trash"><PasswordsIcon name="bin" />סל מחזור</button></div>
        <div data-vault-list></div>
        <p data-vault-empty hidden>לא נמצאו רשומות. אפשר לשנות את החיפוש או את הסינון.</p>
        <button class="vault-add" data-vault-action="add" aria-label="הוסף חשבון לדוגמה"><PasswordsIcon name="plus" /></button>
      </section>
      <section data-vault-panel="detail" hidden aria-labelledby="vault-detail-title">
        <div class="vault-sheet">
          <span class="sheet-handle" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 id="vault-detail-title" tabindex="-1"></h3>
          <p class="simulation-note">פרטי חשבון פיקטיביים להדגמה</p>
          <dl class="credential-fields"><dt>שם משתמש</dt><dd><bdi data-detail-user></bdi></dd><dt>סיסמה לדוגמה</dt><dd class="password-line"><bdi data-detail-password>••••••••••••</bdi><button class="icon-button" data-vault-action="reveal" aria-label="הצג סיסמה לדוגמה" aria-pressed="false"><PasswordsIcon name="eye" /></button></dd></dl>
          <button class="vault-secondary" data-vault-action="favorite" aria-pressed="false">הוסף למועדפים</button>
          <button class="vault-danger" data-vault-action="delete">העבר לסל המחזור</button>
          <button class="vault-primary" data-vault-action="home">סגור</button>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section data-vault-panel="add" hidden aria-labelledby="vault-add-title">
        <h3 id="vault-add-title" tabindex="-1">הוספת פרטי התחברות חדשים</h3>
        <div class="feature-row"><span class="shield-badge"><PasswordsIcon name="shield" /></span><div><strong>בחר חשבון לדוגמה</strong><p>השדות מוכנים מראש. אין להזין מידע אמיתי.</p></div></div>
        <form data-vault-form>
          <label>שם הפלטפורמה<select data-sample-account>{sampleAccounts.map(account => <option value={account.id}>{account.title}</option>)}</select></label>
          <label>שם משתמש / אימייל<input data-sample-user value={sampleAccounts[0].username} readonly dir="ltr" /></label>
          <label>סיסמה לדוגמה<input value={samplePassword} readonly type="password" dir="ltr" /></label>
          <p class="simulation-note">החשבון נשמר בזיכרון ההדגמה עד לרענון או לאיפוס.</p>
          <button class="vault-primary" type="submit">שמור כעת</button>
        </form>
      </section>
      <section data-vault-panel="trash" hidden aria-labelledby="vault-trash-title">
        <h3 id="vault-trash-title" tabindex="-1">סל מחזור</h3>
        <p>אפשר לשחזר את הרשומות שמחקת במהלך ההדגמה.</p>
        <div data-trash-list></div><p data-trash-empty>סל המחזור ריק.</p>
        <button class="vault-secondary" data-vault-action="home">חזרה לרשומות</button>
      </section>
    </div>
    <p class="vault-announcement" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
    <footer class="vault-controls"><button data-vault-action="lock" disabled><PasswordsIcon name="lock" />נעילה</button><button data-vault-action="reset">איפוס ההדגמה ↺</button></footer>
  </div>
  <noscript><p>The interactive demo needs JavaScript. <a href="#screenshots">View the app screenshots.</a></p></noscript>
  <p class="vault-disclosure">UI simulation · Sample accounts only · No biometric authentication or encrypted storage in this demo</p>
</div>
<template id="vault-entry-template"><article class="vault-entry"><button class="entry-open"><span class="entry-monogram" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><strong></strong><small dir="ltr">de***om</small></span></button><button class="entry-star" aria-label="הוסף למועדפים" aria-pressed="false">☆</button></article></template>
<template id="vault-trash-template"><article class="vault-entry"><strong></strong><button class="entry-restore">שחזר</button></article></template>
<script>
  import { initialCredentials, filterCredentials, updateCredential, addSampleAccount, sampleAccounts, samplePassword } from '../data/passwords-demo';
  const root = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-passwords-demo]');
  if (root) {
    const find = <T extends HTMLElement = HTMLElement>(selector: string) => root.querySelector<T>(selector)!;
    let entries = initialCredentials();
    let unlocked = false;
    let category = 'all';
    let favorites = false;
    let selectedId = '';
    let revealed = false;
    const say = (message: string) => { find('.vault-announcement').textContent = message; };
    const mask = () => {
      revealed = false;
      find('[data-detail-password]').textContent = '••••••••••••';
      find('[data-vault-action="reveal"]').setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'false');
      find('[data-vault-action="reveal"]').setAttribute('aria-label', 'הצג סיסמה לדוגמה');
    };
    const show = (panel: string, focus = true) => {
      mask();
      root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-vault-panel]').forEach(element => { element.hidden = element.dataset.vaultPanel !== panel; });
      find('.vault-scroll').scrollTop = 0;
      find('[data-vault-title]').textContent = panel === 'vault' ? 'הסיסמאות השמורות שלי' : 'MY PASSWORDS';
      find<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-vault-action="lock"]').disabled = !unlocked;
      find('.vault-header [data-vault-action="home"]').hidden = !unlocked || panel === 'vault';
      if (focus) find(`[data-vault-panel="${panel}"] h3`).focus({ preventScroll: true });
    };
    const render = () => {
      const list = find('[data-vault-list]'); list.replaceChildren();
      const visible = filterCredentials(entries, find<HTMLInputElement>('[data-vault-search]').value, category, favorites);
      visible.forEach(entry => {
        const row = (document.querySelector<HTMLTemplateElement>('#vault-entry-template')!.content.firstElementChild!.cloneNode(true)) as HTMLElement;
        row.dataset.entry = entry.id;
        row.querySelector('strong')!.textContent = entry.title;
        row.querySelector('.entry-monogram')!.textContent = entry.title[0];
        row.querySelector('.entry-open')!.setAttribute('aria-label', `פתח ${entry.title}`);
        const star = row.querySelector('button.entry-star')!;
        star.textContent = entry.favorite ? '★' : '☆';
        star.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(entry.favorite));
        star.setAttribute('aria-label', `${entry.favorite ? 'הסר ממועדפים' : 'הוסף למועדפים'} ${entry.title}`);
        list.append(row);
      });
      find('[data-visible-count]').textContent = `${visible.length} פריטים בתצוגה`;
      find('[data-vault-empty]').hidden = visible.length > 0;
      root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-vault-category]').forEach(button => button.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(button.dataset.vaultCategory === category)));
      find('[data-vault-action="favorites"]').setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(favorites));
      const trash = filterCredentials(entries, '', 'all', false, true);
      const trashList = find('[data-trash-list]'); trashList.replaceChildren();
      trash.forEach(entry => {
        const row = (document.querySelector<HTMLTemplateElement>('#vault-trash-template')!.content.firstElementChild!.cloneNode(true)) as HTMLElement;
        row.dataset.entry = entry.id;
        row.querySelector('strong')!.textContent = entry.title;
        row.querySelector('button')!.setAttribute('aria-label', `שחזר ${entry.title}`);
        trashList.append(row);
      });
      find('[data-trash-empty]').hidden = trash.length > 0;
    };
    const clearFilters = () => { category = 'all'; favorites = false; find<HTMLInputElement>('[data-vault-search]').value = ''; };
    const lock = (announce = true) => {
      unlocked = false; selectedId = ''; clearFilters();
      find('[data-detail-user]').textContent = '';
      find('#vault-detail-title').textContent = '';
      show('auth', announce);
      if (announce) say('כספת ההדגמה נעולה.');
    };
    find('[data-vault-search]').addEventListener('input', () => { if (unlocked) { render(); say(find('[data-visible-count]').textContent!); } });
    find<HTMLSelectElement>('[data-sample-account]').addEventListener('change', event => {
      const sample = sampleAccounts.find(account => account.id === (event.target as HTMLSelectElement).value)!;
      find<HTMLInputElement>('[data-sample-user]').value = sample.username;
    });
    find<HTMLFormElement>('[data-vault-form]').addEventListener('submit', event => {
      event.preventDefault(); if (!unlocked) return;
      const id = find<HTMLSelectElement>('[data-sample-account]').value;
      const previous = entries.length; entries = addSampleAccount(entries, id);
      if (entries.length === previous) { say('החשבון כבר קיים בהדגמה, או נמצא בסל המחזור.'); return; }
      clearFilters(); render(); show('vault'); say('חשבון הדוגמה נוסף לרשימה.');
    });
    root.addEventListener('click', event => {
      const button = (event.target as Element).closest<HTMLButtonElement>('button');
      if (!button || button.disabled) return;
      const action = button.dataset.vaultAction;
      if (action === 'reset') { entries = initialCredentials(); clearFilters(); unlocked = false; selectedId = ''; find<HTMLFormElement>('[data-vault-form]').reset(); find('[data-detail-user]').textContent = ''; render(); show('welcome'); say('ההדגמה אופסה.'); return; }
      if (action === 'start') { show('auth'); return; }
      if (action === 'unlock') { unlocked = true; render(); show('vault'); say('הסימולציה נפתחה עם חשבונות לדוגמה.'); return; }
      if (!unlocked) return;
      const id = button.closest<HTMLElement>('[data-entry]')?.dataset.entry;
      if (id) {
        const entry = entries.find(item => item.id === id)!;
        if (button.classList.contains('entry-star')) {
          entries = updateCredential(entries, id, { favorite: !entry.favorite }); render();
          (root.querySelector<HTMLElement>(`[data-entry="${id}"] .entry-star`) ?? find('#vault-list-title')).focus({ preventScroll: true });
          say('המועדפים עודכנו.');
        } else if (button.classList.contains('entry-restore')) { entries = updateCredential(entries, id, { deleted: false }); render(); find('#vault-trash-title').focus({ preventScroll: true }); say('הרשומה שוחזרה.'); }
        else {
          selectedId = id;
          find('#vault-detail-title').textContent = entry.title;
          find('[data-detail-user]').textContent = entry.username;
          find('[data-vault-action="favorite"]').setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(entry.favorite));
          find('[data-vault-action="favorite"]').textContent = entry.favorite ? 'הסר ממועדפים' : 'הוסף למועדפים';
          show('detail');
        }
        return;
      }
      if (button.dataset.vaultCategory) { category = button.dataset.vaultCategory; render(); say(find('[data-visible-count]').textContent!); return; }
      switch (action) {
        case 'home': render(); show('vault'); break;
        case 'lock': lock(); break;
        case 'favorites': favorites = !favorites; render(); say(find('[data-visible-count]').textContent!); break;
        case 'trash': render(); show('trash'); break;
        case 'add': show('add'); break;
        case 'delete': entries = updateCredential(entries, selectedId, { deleted: true }); selectedId = ''; render(); show('vault'); say('הרשומה הועברה לסל המחזור.'); break;
        case 'favorite': {
          const entry = entries.find(item => item.id === selectedId)!;
          entries = updateCredential(entries, selectedId, { favorite: !entry.favorite });
          button.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(!entry.favorite));
          button.textContent = entry.favorite ? 'הוסף למועדפים' : 'הסר ממועדפים'; say('המועדפים עודכנו.'); break;
        }
        case 'reveal': revealed = !revealed; find('[data-detail-password]').textContent = revealed ? samplePassword : '••••••••••••'; button.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(revealed)); button.setAttribute('aria-label', revealed ? 'הסתר סיסמה לדוגמה' : 'הצג סיסמה לדוגמה'); break;
      }
    });
    document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', () => { if (document.hidden && unlocked) lock(false); });
    render(); root.hidden = false;
  }
</script>
<style>
  .vault-wrap { width: min(100%, 25rem); min-width: 0; margin-inline: auto; }
  .vault-device { --v-bg: #091321; --v-panel: #142235; --v-line: #2b4058; --v-text: #f1f6ff; --v-muted: #acbed4; --v-teal: #78d8cc; color-scheme: dark; color: var(--v-text); background: var(--v-bg); border: 7px solid #293845; border-radius: 2.2rem; height: clamp(38rem, 185vw, 49rem); overflow: hidden; display: grid; grid-template-rows: 26px 60px minmax(0, 1fr) 42px 54px; font: .875rem/1.5 Arial, sans-serif; box-shadow: 0 24px 65px #0003; }
  .vault-device[hidden], .vault-device [hidden] { display: none !important; }
  .vault-statusbar { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: .25rem 1.2rem; font-size: .7rem; color: var(--v-muted); }
  .vault-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem; padding-inline: .75rem; }
  .vault-header strong { flex: 1; text-align: center; font-size: .9rem; }
  .vault-scroll { overflow-y: auto; overflow-x: hidden; min-height: 0; min-width: 0; padding: .75rem 1rem; overscroll-behavior: contain; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: #2b4058 #091321; }
  section { min-height: 100%; }
  h3 { color: var(--v-text); font-size: 1.45rem; line-height: 1.5; margin: 1rem 0; letter-spacing: -.025em; }
  p { color: var(--v-muted); }
  button, input, select { font: inherit; }
  button { cursor: pointer; min-height: 44px; border: 1px solid var(--v-line); border-radius: .9rem; background: var(--v-panel); color: var(--v-text); padding: .6rem .75rem; }
  button:disabled { color: var(--v-muted); cursor: default; }
  button:focus-visible, input:focus-visible, select:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--v-teal); outline-offset: -3px; }
  .icon-button { display: grid; place-items: center; flex-shrink: 0; width: 44px; padding: .5rem; border-radius: 50%; }
  .shield-badge { display: grid; place-items: center; color: var(--v-teal); background: #143b40; border: 1px solid #25545b; width: 40px; height: 40px; flex-shrink: 0; border-radius: 1rem; }
  .welcome-badge { display: inline-block; font-size: .7rem; color: var(--v-teal); background: #143b40; border-radius: 2rem; padding: .45rem .8rem; }
  .welcome-shield { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 92px; height: 92px; margin: 1.5rem auto; color: var(--v-teal); background: #143b40; border: 1px solid #25545b; border-radius: 40%; box-shadow: 0 0 0 7px #10273b; }
  .welcome-shield :global(svg) { width: 44px; height: 44px; }
  .welcome-copy { line-height: 1.8; }
  .feature-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .8rem; background: var(--v-panel); border: 1px solid var(--v-line); border-radius: 1.3rem; padding: .9rem; margin: 1rem 0; }
  .feature-row p { font-size: .75rem; margin: .2rem 0; }
  .vault-primary { background: #245acb; border-color: #245acb; color: #fff; width: 100%; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 1rem; border-radius: 1.2rem; }
  .vault-primary > span { margin-inline-start: .7rem; }
  .simulation-note { font-size: .75rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .vault-summary { background: var(--v-panel); border: 1px solid var(--v-line); border-radius: 1.7rem; padding: 1rem; }
  .vault-summary h3 { font-size: 1.25rem; margin: 0 0 .4rem; }
  .vault-summary p { font-size: .8rem; margin: 0 0 .7rem; }
  .vault-summary > span { display: inline-block; color: var(--v-teal); background: #143b40; border-radius: 2rem; padding: .35rem .7rem; font-size: .7rem; }
  .vault-search { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
  .vault-search :global(svg) { width: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; color: var(--v-muted); }
  input, select { min-width: 0; width: 100%; min-height: 44px; padding: .7rem; background: #0c1a2c; border: 1px solid var(--v-line); border-radius: .9rem; color: var(--v-text); }
  input::placeholder { color: var(--v-muted); font-size: .75rem; }
  .vault-categories { display: flex; gap: .5rem; margin: .8rem 0 .5rem; }
  .vault-categories button { flex: 1; border-radius: 1.4rem; font-size: .8rem; padding-inline: .4rem; }
  .vault-categories [aria-pressed="true"] { background: #245acb; border-color: #245acb; color: #fff; }
  .vault-tools { display: flex; gap: .5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .vault-tools button { display: flex; gap: .4rem; align-items: center; padding: .3rem .65rem; font-size: .75rem; background: transparent; }
  .vault-tools :global(svg) { width: 16px; }
  .vault-tools [aria-pressed="true"] { color: var(--v-teal); background: #143b40; }
  .vault-add { display: grid; place-items: center; margin: 1.5rem 0 0 auto; background: #245acb; border: 0; color: #fff; width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 1.4rem; }
  .vault-sheet { padding: 1rem; background: var(--v-panel); border: 1px solid var(--v-line); border-radius: 1.6rem; }
  .sheet-handle { display: block; width: 2rem; height: 4px; background: #4d617a; border-radius: 1rem; margin: 0 auto 1rem; }
  .vault-sheet h3 { text-align: center; }
  .credential-fields { margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  dt { color: var(--v-muted); font-size: .75rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
  dd { margin: .5rem 0; border: 1px solid var(--v-line); background: #0c1a2c; border-radius: .9rem; padding: .7rem; overflow-wrap: anywhere; font-size: .8rem; }
  .password-line { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: .4rem; justify-content: space-between; }
  .password-line button { background: transparent; border: 0; }
  .vault-secondary, .vault-danger { width: 100%; margin-top: .7rem; }
  .vault-secondary[aria-pressed="true"] { color: var(--v-teal); background: #143b40; }
  .vault-danger { color: #ffb4ab; background: #45262d; }
  form label { display: grid; gap: .7rem; margin-top: 1.4rem; font-weight: 600; font-size: .85rem; }
  .vault-announcement { margin: 0; padding: .2rem 1rem; min-width: 0; overflow-y: auto; font-size: .7rem; color: var(--v-teal); }
  .vault-controls { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; border-top: 1px solid var(--v-line); padding: .2rem .6rem; }
  .vault-controls button { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .4rem; border: 0; background: transparent; font-size: .75rem; }
  .vault-controls :global(svg) { width: 16px; }
  .vault-disclosure { color: var(--muted); font-size: .75rem; text-align: center; margin: 1rem 0 0; }
  :global(.vault-entry) { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .4rem; background: #142235; border: 1px solid #2b4058; border-radius: 1.5rem; padding: .65rem; margin-top: .8rem; color: #f1f6ff; }
